on

The first word of this file is the switch for field metrics. With on,
.github/workflows/metrics.yml writes the project's aggregates (counts,
durations and rates, never a name, a title or any text) to the branch
metrics, where OpenSpineConsortium's collector reads them if this repository
installed the OpenSpine SDLC App. With off, it writes only that sharing is
off. The repository variable SDLC_METRICS set to off turns sharing off too,
whatever this file says. docs/setup/metrics.md says what is computed.
